  lines:
  - portrait: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    dialogueText: 'Days turned into weeks.


      The store was still small, but
      people were starting to recognize our name.'
  - portrait: {fileID: 0}
    speakerName: 
    dialogueText: 'More customers began walking through our doors.


      For the
      first time...


      It felt like this business might actually succeed.'
